@ Snow Effect colours (code/tweaks/snow_colors.cpp). The snow actor's onExecute (0x606A3990,
@ vtable 0x60C19300 + 0x20) starts with `push {r4-r11, lr}`, so the trampoline can replay it.

SnowColors_onExecute:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x006A3990
    symbol:     ModBase::snowColors::onExecute(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::snowColors::onExecute_orig(StageActor*)
